        "title": "华为徐直军：昇腾中国市场份额已超英伟达，中国芯片自主化是必然之路",
        "uri": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3783066"
      },
      "author": {
        "avatar": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/714916ad-9609-4245-94b4-dfe9518a63c3",
        "display_name": "万小婷",
